{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30737","headline":"忆朝阳峰前居 · 项斯","name":"忆朝阳峰前居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每忆闲眠处，朝阳最上峰。\n溪僧来自远，林路出无踪。\n败褐黏苔徧，新题出石重。\n霞光侵曙发，岚翠近秋浓。\n健羡机能破，安危道不逢。\n雪残猨到阁，庭午鹤离松。\n此地虚爲别，人间久未容。\n何时无一事，却去养疎慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}